        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/958977/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-27T08:19:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just making sure, the Spell Value on the bottom right corner is random?<br><br>I noticed on two Heedless Lash that one is \"3\" and the other is \"2.\" Spiff's checklist only shows the value of \"3\" only, so I was confuse if the values are meant to be different.</p>",
