        "created_at": "2013-03-27T09:00:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes. they're different. This is what makes NightMist a more complicated, and sometimes frustrating, character. No two copies of the same card have the same points cost. The points are relatively evenly split between 1 and 4 with a slight bump the middle.</p>",
