        "created_at": "2013-03-27T09:03:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's not quite random. IIRC, the distributions are all [1,2,3],[2,3,4],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4] or [1,4].</p><p>EDIT: Actually now that I think of it I'm wrong. Astral Premonition is [2,4].</p>",
